<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! carriage.relay.rotates ~ a fresh relay gate seed, and the pin hearths adopt after restart

`lares herm relay-rotate` replaces the herm's relay gate seed in its own durable identity-home row and prints the new gate key. The standing herm keeps the old gate until it restarts; hand every dialing hearth the new pin, then restart the herm.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ rotate

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`rotate` params=`~ mint the new gate and print its pin`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

